    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightrix is a sleek, minimalist puzzle game about blending colored lights to match target hues across a glowing matrix of cubes. Using intuitive logic and a clean interface, players manipulate  light to complete each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game includes 30 handcrafted puzzles that gradually introduce new complexities, alongside an endless mode designed for relaxed, meditative play\u2014perfect for unwinding like a game of sudoku with a futuristic twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With sharp visual design, responsive controls, and both day and night modes for aesthetic flexibility, Lightrix offers a focused and satisfying single-player experience that\u2019s as stylish as it is smart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 unique handcrafted puzzle levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode for infinite, casual challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleek, sci-fi-inspired visuals with dynamic lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night visual modes for personal preference</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive color-mixing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, logic-based gameplay perfect for short bursts or long sessions</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightrix is a sleek, minimalist puzzle game about blending colored lights to match target hues across a glowing matrix of cubes. Using intuitive logic and a clean interface, players manipulate  light to complete each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game includes 30 handcrafted puzzles that gradually introduce new complexities, alongside an endless mode designed for relaxed, meditative play\u2014perfect for unwinding like a game of sudoku with a futuristic twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With sharp visual design, responsive controls, and both day and night modes for aesthetic flexibility, Lightrix offers a focused and satisfying single-player experience that\u2019s as stylish as it is smart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 unique handcrafted puzzle levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode for infinite, casual challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleek, sci-fi-inspired visuals with dynamic lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night visual modes for personal preference</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive color-mixing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, logic-based gameplay perfect for short bursts or long sessions</p></li></ul>",
